description=Optional add-on for GoM Extension: Guns of Tien with eleven guns from after July 1993: the H&K MP7 (in the main mod's short SMG stance) and the FN P90 TR (held like a pistol), the FN Five-seveN pistol, the H&K UCP Prototype pistol, the FN SCAR-L and SCAR-H rifles, the H&K UMP45 and UMP9 submachine guns and the Steyr AUG A3, AUG Para and AUG HBAR, with their magazines (MP7 20, 30, 40 and a 60-round drum; P90 50; Five-seveN 20 and 30; UCP 20 and a 40-round drum; SCAR-H 20, 10 and a 50-round drum, the SCAR-L takes Guns of Marz's STANAG magazines; UMP45 25, 20 and 10; UMP9 30; AUG Para 25 and 32; AUG HBAR 30 and 50, the AUG A3 takes the AUG A1's), suppressors, and 4.6x30mm and 5.7x28mm ammunition, which can also be made with Ammo Maker (optional). Enable it together with GoM Extension: Guns of Tien.
